    "raw": "We know of several breeds of Thelusian. The most common, seen all over the galaxy now, are Workers. They explore, collect and collate data for the Hive Queen. Warriors are second most common, and are typically found in mercenary companies or employed by wealthy clients.",
    "value": "据我们所知，蚁族存在数个亚种。如今遍布全宇宙中最为常见的是工蚁，他们负责为女王探索、收集并整理信息。兵蚁次之，通常可见于雇佣兵团体，或受雇于富有的客户。"
