  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Then, you have Drones who have one single function: Breed. They are expendable and left to die at the end of every breeding cycle outside of the hive. Finally, the Queen rules the roost. We don't know if there is a single queen for all Thelusians or if each hive has a unique Queen. They aren't telling, and we've no way to know otherwise.",
    "value": "再者是繁殖蚁，其唯一使命便是繁衍。它们被视为可消耗品，在每个巢外繁殖周期结束后便遭遗弃而亡。最终，女王统御一切。我们无从知晓，是所有蚁族共奉一位女王，还是每个巢穴自有其主。蚁族对此缄口不言，而我们亦无他法可知。"
